Here is the UVL-Code based on the given text:

```uvl
namespace BillingSoftware

features
	BillingSoftware {abstract}
		mandatory
			TaxCalculator {abstract}
				mandatory
					Inputs
						mandatory
							NettoPrice {Measure 'Netto price'}
							SumOfProducts {Measure 'Sum of products'}
							LocationOfBuyerSeller {Text 'Location of buyer/seller'}
					Outputs
						mandatory
							TaxPerProduct {Measure 'Tax per product'}
							BruttoPrice {Measure 'Brutto price'}
							TaxRate {Measure 'Tax rate'}
						optional
							LoggingData {Text 'Logging data'}
								mandatory
									CalculatedBasePrice {Measure 'Calculated base price'}
									RuleOfCalculation {Text 'Rule of calculation'}

constraints
	!TaxCalculator.TaxCalculator => TaxCalculator
```